WEBVTT
NOTE smp12-v3-2-2 en — new narration (Fahad, 2026-10-20); captions spread across the speech by word count (not from the audio): check by eye

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.899
How is that different from other events?

2
00:00:03.099 --> 00:00:10.324
At a concert, people rush in when the doors open, and the pressure builds at the front of the stage.

3
00:00:10.524 --> 00:00:19.976
At a festival or a fan zone, people arrive through the day and move between stages and food areas, and the busy moment is closing time.

4
00:00:20.176 --> 00:00:23.317
In all three, people leave together at the end.

5
00:00:23.517 --> 00:00:30.000
You may be posted to a fan zone during the tournament, so it helps to know the difference.
